---
import './pickup-details-handoff.css';
---

<figure class="dd-pickup-handoff not-prose" aria-labelledby="ddph-title">
  <header class="ddph-heading">
    <h3 id="ddph-title">Same pickup.<br />When do you identify it?</h3>
  </header>

  <label class="ddph-control" aria-labelledby="ddph-control-label">
    <input class="ddph-toggle" type="checkbox" aria-controls="ddph-journey ddph-result" />
    <span id="ddph-control-label"><strong>Confirm pickup details before arrival</strong><span>Match the reference and share it with the driver.</span></span>
  </label>

  <div class="ddph-journey" id="ddph-journey" role="group" aria-label="Pickup identification before and after the driver arrives">
    <section class="ddph-stage ddph-before-arrival">
      <h4>Before arrival</h4>
      <div class="ddph-unconfirmed ddph-note">Pickup details have not been confirmed.</div>
      <div class="ddph-confirmed ddph-note"><strong>Pickup reference: PICK-1042</strong><span>Shipping has matched it to the expected order and shared it with the driver.</span></div>
    </section>

    <div class="ddph-arrival">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 52 32" width="46" height="29" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M3 4h28v20H3zM31 11h10l8 8v5H31M36 15h4l5 5h-9z" />
        <circle cx="12" cy="26" r="4" /><circle cx="40" cy="26" r="4" />
      </svg>
      <strong>Driver arrives</strong>
    </div>

    <section class="ddph-stage ddph-after-arrival">
      <h4>On arrival</h4>
      <div class="ddph-unconfirmed">
        <p class="ddph-chain-intro">The warehouse cannot identify the pickup.</p>
        <ol class="ddph-chain">
          <li><span>Driver</span>Asks dispatch</li>
          <li><span>Dispatch</span>Asks the customer</li>
          <li><span>Shipping team</span>Matches the pickup</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="ddph-confirmed ddph-note"><strong>The reference matches.</strong><span>The driver and shipping team have the same pickup details.</span></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="ddph-result" id="ddph-result" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
    <div class="ddph-unconfirmed"><strong>The truck waits while the pickup is identified.</strong><p>Each answer depends on reaching the next person after arrival.</p></div>
    <div class="ddph-confirmed"><strong>The pickup is identified before the truck arrives.</strong><p>The questions were resolved earlier. The shipping team can find the expected order at check-in.</p></div>
  </div>

</figure>
